  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Thinly slice the capsicum, discarding the seeds and membrane. Thinly slice the onion and 2 garlic cloves. Peel the sweet potato and cut into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/63048/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_01-3c5e09c19014ea60abcdf05ac61091d4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook sweet potato: Heat 1½ tbs olive oil in a medium frypan over medium heat. Add the sweet potato and 2 tbs water, season with salt and pepper and cover with a lid. Cook, stirring occasionally, for 8-10 mins until almost tender. Add the onion, garlic and capsicum and cook, uncovered, for a further 5 mins or until the vegetables are slightly caramelised on the bottom.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/63049/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_02-2926580d9bbc8c56d65fa9aea6b809f9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add smoky BBQ seasoning: Add 1½ tsp of the smoky BBQ seasoning (the remaining seasoning won't be used in this dish) and cook, tossing, for a further 2 mins or until fragrant. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/63050/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_03-a49ec27f5bf99ddf4ba0511d16af9859.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake eggs: Make 2 egg-sized indents in the sweet potato mixture and crack 2 eggs into the indents. Cover with the lid, reduce the heat to low and cook for 4-5 mins until the eggs are just set.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/63051/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_04-bc759d4f4e2c78354fd94ba1a59b85a9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Meanwhile, coarsely mash the avocado with 2 tsp olive oil in a bowl and season with salt and pepper. Divide the sweet potato hash among plates and top with the rocket and guacamole to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/63052/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_05-5a7a1690f603c65ff6737795493d279d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Experiment with different spice blends, such as Cajun, or serve with a dollop of sour cream.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/63053/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_HACK-4d24763fbe97269c0089cc30f420a7fa.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
